WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Reach tells you who had a chance to see it. Then what?

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Script: show a simple funnel: reach, meaningful engagement, outbound click, completed action. Explain that each step answers a different question. Compare like with like and avoid calling correlation proof of causation.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Pick one funnel step to improve this month.
